const topics=['자기소개와 관심 있는 AI 제품','내 프로젝트와 고객 문제','AI 제품의 가치와 한계','AI가 바꿀 학교와 일','초기 고객과 제품 피드백','창업 경험과 예상 밖의 질문','수업 토론과 캠퍼스 생활','밋업·일상 대화 종합 리허설'];
const prompts={preply:'Let’s simulate a casual startup meetup. Keep your turns short and ask unexpected follow-up questions. Please save corrections until the end, then help me redo three moments where I got stuck.',ringle:'Please challenge my opinion and ask follow-up questions. I want to practice explaining my reasoning, responding to objections, and asking for clarification. Please give me three priority corrections at the end.',ai:'You’re a founder I just met at a startup meetup. Ask one question at a time and keep your replies brief. Ask follow-up questions based on my answers. After the conversation, correct three phrases and let me try them again.'};
const key='english-in-motion-v1';let state={week:1,checks:{},notes:{}};let storageOK=true;try{const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key));if(saved&&typeof saved==='object'){if(Number.isInteger(saved.week)&&saved.week>=1&&saved.week<=8)state.week=saved.week;if(saved.checks&&typeof saved.checks==='object')state.checks=saved.checks;if(saved.notes&&typeof saved.notes==='object')state.notes=saved.notes}}catch{storageOK=false}
let selected=(new Date().getDay()+6)%7;const select=document.querySelector('#week');for(let w=1;w<=8;w++)select.add(new Option(`Week ${String(w).padStart(2,'0')}`,w));select.value=state.week;
function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(state));document.querySelector('#save-status').textContent='저장됨'}catch{storageOK=false;document.querySelector('#save-status').textContent='저장할 수 없습니다. 브라우저 저장소 설정을 확인하세요.'}}
function updateProgress(){let done=0;days.forEach((d,i)=>d.tasks.forEach((_,j)=>{if(state.checks[`${state.week}-${i}-${j}`])done++}));document.querySelector('#progress').textContent=`${done} / 19 완료`;document.querySelector('#progress-fill').style.width=`${done/19*100}%`;document.querySelector('#week-focus').textContent=`WEEK ${String(state.week).padStart(2,'0')} · ${topics[state.week-1]}`}
function render(){const tabs=document.querySelector('.days');tabs.replaceChildren();days.forEach((d,i)=>{const button=document.createElement('button');button.className='day';button.id=`tab-${i}`;button.setAttribute('role','tab');button.setAttribute('aria-selected',i===selected);button.setAttribute('aria-controls','day-detail');button.tabIndex=i===selected?0:-1;button.innerHTML=`<span class="day-num">0${i+1}</span><span class="day-name">${d.day}요일</span><span class="day-time">${d.time}분</span>`;button.onclick=()=>{selected=i;render();document.querySelector(`#tab-${i}`).focus()};button.onkeydown=e=>{let n;if(e.key==='ArrowDown'||e.key==='ArrowRight')n=(i+1)%7;if(e.key==='ArrowUp'||e.key==='ArrowLeft')n=(i+6)%7;if(e.key==='Home')n=0;if(e.key==='End')n=6;if(n!==undefined){e.preventDefault();selected=n;render();document.querySelector(`#tab-${n}`).focus()}};tabs.append(button)});const d=days[selected];const panel=document.querySelector('#day-detail');panel.setAttribute('aria-labelledby',`tab-${selected}`);panel.innerHTML=`<div class="detail-heading"><h3>${d.name}</h3><span class="time-badge">${d.time} MIN</span></div><p class="detail-sub">${d.sub}</p>`;d.tasks.forEach((task,j)=>{const id=`${state.week}-${selected}-${j}`;const label=document.createElement('label');label.className='task';label.innerHTML=`<input type="checkbox"><span class="task-text"><span>${task[0]}</span><small>${task[2]}</small></span><span class="task-min">${task[1]}분</span>`;const input=label.querySelector('input');input.checked=Boolean(state.checks[id]);input.onchange=()=>{state.checks[id]=input.checked;save();updateProgress()};panel.append(label)});const l=document.createElement('label');l.className='note-label';l.htmlFor='daily-note';l.textContent='오늘 써본 표현 / 막혔던 순간';const note=document.createElement('textarea');note.id='daily-note';note.placeholder='예: What makes you say that? / 프로젝트의 고객을 설명하다가 멈췄다.';note.value=typeof state.notes[`${state.week}-${selected}`]==='string'?state.notes[`${state.week}-${selected}`]:'';note.oninput=()=>{state.notes[`${state.week}-${selected}`]=note.value;save()};panel.append(l,note);updateProgress()}
select.onchange=()=>{state.week=Number(select.value);save();render()};let toastTimeout;function toast(message){const el=document.querySelector('#toast');el.textContent=message;el.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(toastTimeout);toastTimeout=setTimeout(()=>el.classList.remove('show'),2500)}document.querySelectorAll('.copy').forEach(button=>button.onclick=async()=>{const text=prompts[button.dataset.prompt];try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);toast('연습 요청문을 복사했어요.')}catch{const area=document.querySelector('#copy-text');area.value=text;document.querySelector('#copy-dialog').showModal();area.focus();area.select()}});document.querySelector('#close-dialog').onclick=()=>document.querySelector('#copy-dialog').close();render();if(!storageOK)document.querySelector('#save-status').textContent='브라우저 저장소를 사용할 수 없어 기록이 유지되지 않을 수 있습니다.';
